<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MindCare AI | Mental Health Report</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2pdf.js/0.10.1/html2pdf.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        :root {
            --primary: #5d5fef;
            --primary-light: #e0e1ff;
            --secondary: #4ecdc4;
            --accent: #ff6b6b;
            --light: #f8f9fa;
            --dark: #2d3436;
            --gray: #a5b1c2;
            --success: #1dd1a1;
            --warning: #feca57;
            --danger: #ff6b6b;
            --shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            --radius: 12px;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f0f2f5;
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #6c5ce7);
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .logo i {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .logo h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .header-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .user-info {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .report-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: white;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .disclaimer {
            background-color: #fff9e6;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--warning);
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
        }

        .disclaimer h4 {
            color: var(--warning);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .disclaimer p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }

        .report-section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .section-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }

        .section-title i {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .content-box {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .content-box h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .content-box p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .content-box ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .content-box li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .highlight {
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .stat-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-value {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--gray);
        }

        .condition-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .condition-card {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .condition-card.warning {
            border-left-color: var(--warning);
        }

        .condition-card.danger {
            border-left-color: var(--danger);
        }

        .condition-card h4 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .recommendation-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .recommendation-card {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .recommendation-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .recommendation-content h4 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .recommendation-content p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            color: var(--gray);
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header-info {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .report-actions {
                justify-content: center;
                margin-top: 15px;
            }
            
            .stat-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
            
            .condition-list, .recommendation-list {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media print {
            .no-print {
                display: none;
            }
            
            body {
                background-color: white;
            }
            
            .report-section {
                box-shadow: none;
                border: 1px solid #ddd;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container" id="report-content">
        <header>
            <div class="logo">
                <i class="fas fa-brain"></i>
                <h1>MindCare AI</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="header-info">
                <div>
                    <h2>Mental Health Chat Report</h2>
                    <div class="user-info">
                        <p><strong>Generated for:</strong> kshitijjadhav45@gmail.com</p>
                        <p><strong>Date:</strong> <span id="current-date"></span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="report-actions">
                    <button class="btn btn-primary no-print" id="downloadPdf">
                        <i class="fas fa-file-pdf"></i> Download PDF Report
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary no-print" id="printReport">
                        <i class="fas fa-print"></i> Print Report
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="disclaimer">
            <h4><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Important Disclaimer</h4>
            <p>This report is generated by an AI and is not a substitute for professional diagnosis or treatment. The information provided is for informational and supportive purposes only. If you are experiencing mental health challenges, please seek help from a qualified mental health professional.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Detailed Summary Section -->
        <section class="report-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i>
                <h2>Detailed Summary</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="content-box">
                <p>This report summarizes the analysis of your chat interactions with MindCare AI. Based on the content and patterns detected in your conversations, the following insights have been generated to help you better understand your mental well-being.</p>
                
                <div class="stat-grid">
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-value">8</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Total Interactions</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-value">1</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Sessions Detected</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-value">4.33/10</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Average Mood Score</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-value">33.33%</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Negative Mood Proportion</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="highlight">
                    <p><strong>Overview:</strong> Your chat data suggests a generally positive mood with an average score of 4.33 out of 10. However, the presence of negative mood mentions (33.33% of your messages) indicates some emotional fluctuations that warrant attention.</p>
                </div>
                
                <p>The limited data from a single session prevents a comprehensive trend analysis, but the patterns detected provide valuable insights into your current mental state.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Detected Conditions Section -->
        <section class="report-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <i class="fas fa-stethoscope"></i>
                <h2>Detected Conditions & Concerns</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="content-box">
                <p>Based on the analysis of your chat content, the following conditions and concerns have been identified. Please note that these are preliminary observations and not clinical diagnoses.</p>
                
                <div class="condition-list">
                    <div class="condition-card warning">
                        <h4><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Emotional Fluctuations</h4>
                        <p>Your chat data shows variability in mood states, with both positive expressions and negative mentions. This could indicate stress or situational emotional challenges.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="condition-card">
                        <h4><i class="fas fa-brain"></i> Potential Stress Indicators</h4>
                        <p>The presence of negative mood mentions suggests possible stress factors in your life that may need addressing.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="condition-card danger">
                        <h4><i class="fas fa-user-md"></i> Need for Professional Assessment</h4>
                        <p>Due to limited data, a comprehensive assessment isn't possible. Consultation with a mental health professional is recommended for accurate evaluation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="highlight">
                    <p><strong>Important:</strong> No clinical conditions can be definitively identified based on the available chat data. These observations should be discussed with a qualified mental health professional for proper assessment.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Patterns and Trends Section -->
        <section class="report-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                <h2>Patterns and Trends</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="content-box">
                <h3>Mood Patterns</h3>
                <p>Analysis of your chat interactions reveals the following patterns:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Mood Variability:</strong> Your expressions show fluctuations between positive and negative emotional states within the same session.</li>
                    <li><strong>Negative Mention Frequency:</strong> Approximately one-third of your messages contained negative mood indicators.</li>
                    <li><strong>Session Consistency:</strong> All interactions occurred within a single session, preventing longitudinal trend analysis.</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h3>Communication Patterns</h3>
                <p>Your chat behavior shows:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Engagement Level:</strong> Moderate engagement with 8 total interactions in the session.</li>
                    <li><strong>Expression Style:</strong> Mixed emotional expression with both positive and negative content.</li>
                    <li><strong>Topic Focus:</strong> Varied topics with emotional content being a significant component.</li>
                </ul>
                
                <div class="highlight">
                    <p><strong>Note on Data Limitations:</strong> The patterns identified are based on limited data from a single session. More consistent tracking over time would provide clearer insights into your mental health trends.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Suggested Solutions Section -->
        <section class="report-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i>
                <h2>Suggested Solutions & Recommendations</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="content-box">
                <p>Based on the analysis of your chat data, the following solutions and recommendations are suggested to support your mental well-being:</p>
                
                <div class="recommendation-list">
                    <div class="recommendation-card">
                        <div class="recommendation-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-clipboard-list"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="recommendation-content">
                            <h4>Regular Mood Tracking</h4>
                            <p>Maintain a daily mood journal to identify patterns and triggers for emotional fluctuations.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="recommendation-card">
                        <div class="recommendation-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-spa"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="recommendation-content">
                            <h4>Mindfulness Practice</h4>
                            <p>Incorporate daily mindfulness or meditation exercises to improve emotional regulation.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="recommendation-card">
                        <div class="recommendation-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-hiking"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="recommendation-content">
                            <h4>Physical Activity</h4>
                            <p>Engage in regular physical exercise, which has proven benefits for mental health.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="recommendation-card">
                        <div class="recommendation-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="recommendation-content">
                            <h4>Social Connection</h4>
                            <p>Increase positive social interactions to combat potential feelings of isolation.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="recommendation-card">
                        <div class="recommendation-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-user-md"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="recommendation-content">
                            <h4>Professional Consultation</h4>
                            <p>Schedule an appointment with a mental health professional for comprehensive assessment.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="recommendation-card">
                        <div class="recommendation-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-bed"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="recommendation-content">
                            <h4>Sleep Hygiene</h4>
                            <p>Establish a consistent sleep routine to improve overall mental well-being.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="highlight">
                    <p><strong>Next Steps:</strong> Consider implementing 2-3 of these recommendations that resonate with you, and track your progress over the next few weeks. Consistent practice is key to seeing improvements in mental well-being.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <p>Report generated by MindCare AI | Confidential Mental Health Document</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Set current date
        document.getElementById('current-date').textContent = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { 
            weekday: 'long', 
            year: 'numeric', 
            month: 'long', 
            day: 'numeric' 
        });

        // PDF Download Functionality
        document.getElementById('downloadPdf').addEventListener('click', function() {
            const element = document.getElementById('report-content');
            const options = {
                margin: 10,
                filename: 'MindCare_AI_Report_' + new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10) + '.pdf',
                image: { type: 'jpeg', quality: 0.98 },
                html2canvas: { scale: 2 },
                jsPDF: { unit: 'mm', format: 'a4', orientation: 'portrait' }
            };
            
            html2pdf().set(options).from(element).save();
        });

        // Print Functionality
        document.getElementById('printReport').addEventListener('click', function() {
            window.print();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>